{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7669675127367895301","title":"用户产品经理 - 番茄小说","description":"团队介绍：番茄小说是抖音在 2019 年推出的免费阅读产品，致力于为读者提供优质的阅读体验。番茄小说拥有海量正版小说，涵盖言情、都市、玄幻、悬疑等主流网文类型，以及大量热剧原著和经典出版物，支持用户看书、听书。\n\n1、负责番茄小说的用户产品功能与策略设计，提升端内小说用户的用户体验与分发效率，为时长和留存目标负责；\n2、通过数据分析和定性观察等方式，挖掘需求痛点，提出假设及解决方案，推动产品持续创新，切实解决用户体验问题；\n3、协调内外部资源，推进产品项目全流程的高效运转，保证功能和策略高质量落地。","requirement":"1、2027届获得本科及以上学历；\n2、内容感佳，对小说、听书、短漫剧等各类内容产品有深入思考，小说深度用户优先；自驱力强，对做好产品有热情，团队协作和执行力强，充满责任心；\n3、逻辑清晰，对数据敏感，有扎实的数据分析能力。","job_category":{"id":"6704215864629004552","name":"产品","en_name":"Product","i18n_name":"产品","depth":1,"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","i18n_name":"深圳"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785735415003,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A67309A","job_id":"7668208065528957189","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen